{
  "name": "Weekly Competitor Google Ads & EU DSA Creative Monitor to Sheets and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly Competitor Google Ads & EU DSA Creative Monitor\n\n### How it works\nThis workflow monitors competitor Google Search, YouTube, and Display ad activity every week and sends concise creative digests to Slack:\n1. **Weekly Schedule Trigger** and **Set Target Domains** kick off the run for your competitor domain list.\n2. **Screen Domains for Active Google Ads** sends all domains in one batch (`POST /screen`) via RapidAPI (`google-ads-transparency-creative-spy`), and **Split Out Screened Domains** unpacks each company record.\n3. **Filter Active Advertisers** keeps only domains with `hasActiveAds = true`, then **Fetch Top Active Creatives** (`GET /search`) pulls up to 5 active creatives per advertiser.\n4. **Format Ad Digest Row** extracts advertiser name, creative count, latest format, and last shown date, and **Send Weekly Ad Digest to Slack** posts the summary to `#marketing-intel`.\n\n### Setup\n1. Subscribe to the free Basic plan on RapidAPI (`google-ads-transparency-creative-spy`).\n2. Create a **Header Auth** credential named `RapidAPI Key` with header `x-rapidapi-key` and attach it to both **Screen Domains for Active Google Ads** and **Fetch Top Active Creatives**.\n3. Connect your **Slack** credential and choose a target channel in **Send Weekly Ad Digest to Slack**.\n4. Update the competitor list in **Set Target Domains** and test the workflow.\n\n### Customization\n- Change **Weekly Schedule Trigger** to daily or add a **Google Sheets** / **Airtable** node alongside Slack to archive historical creative counts.\n- Change `region: 'ALL'` in **Screen Domains for Active Google Ads** to a specific country code (e.g., `'US'` or `'DE'`) to narrow EU DSA reach monitoring.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "google-overview-note",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Schedule & Target Domains\nRuns weekly and defines the array of competitor domains to check for active Google Ads campaigns.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "adp-sec-1",
      "name": "Step 1: Schedule & Targets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Batch Screen Active Ads\nCalls `POST /screen` in one batch request to check which target domains currently run Google Ads, then splits out each domain.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "adp-sec-2",
      "name": "Step 2: Batch Screen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Filter, Fetch Creatives & Format\nFilters active advertisers (`hasActiveAds = true`), fetches up to 5 top creatives via `GET /search`, and formats advertiser name, format, and last shown date.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "adp-sec-3",
      "name": "Step 3: Filter & Fetch Creatives",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1020,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Post Digest to Slack\nPosts each active advertiser's creative update to your Slack channel (`#marketing-intel` by default).",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "adp-sec-4",
      "name": "Step 4: Slack Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1820,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ff3bcf6a-b339-48ee-a92e-898ce37db58d",
      "name": "Weekly Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        40,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b5ad136d-6488-400a-bb82-f7190f3d60f7",
              "name": "domains",
              "value": "={{ ['shopify.com', 'hubspot.com', 'zalando.de'] }}",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "62f744b7-b8d5-4bc4-bc33-44e8c7b3979e",
      "name": "Set Target Domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        280,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://google-ads-transparency-creative-spy.p.rapidapi.com/screen",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-rapidapi-host",
              "value": "google-ads-transparency-creative-spy.p.rapidapi.com"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ domains: $json.domains, region: 'ALL' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "4a8f550e-ae33-47fd-b9a3-859c8c38f0c5",
      "name": "Screen Domains for Active Google Ads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        260
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "RapidAPI Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "items",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "06420fc2-747f-42b0-90bb-820e71f842b4",
      "name": "Split Out Screened Domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        820,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "55ab68a1-1d3e-4d1f-8341-f86f875c72ee",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.hasActiveAds }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "fcd8d04d-655e-434d-9926-5fb8936fa6d1",
      "name": "Filter Active Advertisers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://google-ads-transparency-creative-spy.p.rapidapi.com/search",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "query",
              "value": "={{ $json.domain }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "maxResults",
              "value": "5"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-rapidapi-host",
              "value": "google-ads-transparency-creative-spy.p.rapidapi.com"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "fc99c216-3c45-4bf1-89ee-396ed76debf8",
      "name": "Fetch Top Active Creatives",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "RapidAPI Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c84be687-768c-44df-8778-a556e9d9718a",
              "name": "advertiser",
              "value": "={{ $json.items?.[0]?.advertiserName || 'Unknown' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "769baa86-db32-4469-b23b-85d5aa7d8c63",
              "name": "creativeCount",
              "value": "={{ $json.count || 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "8e0decc0-88a6-447d-bae3-f92061d2ed5a",
              "name": "latestFormat",
              "value": "={{ $json.items?.[0]?.format || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "59d6a3e7-35ec-490a-a8d1-89dedfb885ac",
              "name": "lastShownDate",
              "value": "={{ $json.items?.[0]?.lastShownDate || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "013284f9-6c82-4fee-a5e4-b1ad93fe6d86",
      "name": "Format Ad Digest Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1620,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
